.el .ds Aq '
.TH urlmenu-copy 1  "copy " 
.SH NAME
urlmenu\-copy \- Copy the cleaned URL to the clipboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBurlmenu copy\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copy the cleaned URL to the clipboard
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print what would run as JSON instead of running it
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>

